rting at 9.69% p.a. (\u20b926.55/day per \u20b91 Lakh borrowed), followed by m.Stock at 9.99% p.a., Dhan at 12.49% p.a., and Zerodha at 14.60% p.a."},{"question":"At what price does CANHLIFE trigger an MTF margin call or liquidation?","answer":"With a 25% initial margin, CANHLIFE has a safety buffer of approximately 21.0%. If the price falls to \u20b996.68, your broker will issue a margin shortfall notice. Positions must also be authorized via CDSL/NSDL OTP pledge before 9:00 PM on T-day."}],"last_updated":"2026-10-30T08:01:59.796649Z"}